id: pm-vcs-zrxk
title: Merge base over the commit DAG and three-way content merge
description: Ancestry queries and a lowest-common-ancestor search that handles multiple candidate bases from criss-cross merges rather than assuming a single one. On top of it a diff3 content merge that takes non-overlapping edits from both sides and emits conflict markers only where both sides changed the same region.
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 1
