author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: The merge base of two branches off one commit is that commit; a fast-forward is detected and takes no merge; edits to different regions of one file both survive; overlapping edits produce a conflict with both sides preserved; a criss-cross history yields a correct result rather than an arbitrary base
